</div><table class="nowraplinks navbox-subgroup" style="border-spacing:0"><tbody><tr><th id="Planets,_dwarfs,_minors5054" scope="row" class="navbox-group" style="width:1%;text-align:center;"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Planet" title="Planet">Planets</a>,<br/> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dwarf_planet" title="Dwarf planet">dwarfs</a>, <br/> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minor_planet" title="Minor planet">minors</a></th><td class="navbox-list-with-group navbox-list navbox-even" style="width:100%;padding:0"><div style="padding:0 0.25em">
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrestrial_planet" title="Terrestrial planet">Terrestrials</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury_(planet)" title="Mercury (planet)">Mercury</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Venus" title="Venus">Venus</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Earth" title="Earth">Earth</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mars" title="Mars">Mars</a></li></ul></li>
