<p><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Solar_System" title="Solar System">Solar System</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Local_Interstellar_Cloud" title="Local Interstellar Cloud">Local Interstellar Cloud</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Local_Bubble" title="Local Bubble">Local Bubble</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gould_Belt" title="Gould Belt">Gould Belt</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orion_Arm" title="Orion Arm">Orion Arm</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Milky_Way" title="Milky Way">Milky Way</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Satellite_galaxies_of_the_Milky_Way" title="Satellite galaxies of the Milky Way">Milky Way subgroup</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span> <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Local_Group" title="Local Group">Local Group</a> <span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Local_Sheet" title="Local Sheet">Local Sheet</a> <span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Local_Volume" title="Local Volume">Local Volume</a> <span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Virgo_Supercluster" title="Virgo Supercluster">Virgo Supercluster</a> <span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laniakea_Supercluster" title="Laniakea Supercluster">Laniakea Supercluster</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pisces–Cetus_Supercluster_Complex" title="Pisces–Cetus Supercluster Complex">Pisces–Cetus Supercluster Complex</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Local_Hole" title="Local Hole">Local Hole</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Observable_universe" title="Observable universe">Observable universe</a><span typeof="mw:Entity"> </span><span style="font-size:120%">→</span>  <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Universe" title="Universe">Universe</a><br/><span style="font-size: 85%;">Each arrow (<span style="font-size:120%">→</span>) may be read as "within" or "part of".</span></p>
